MediaPipe BlazeFace (Short Range)
=================================

`blaze_face_short_range.tflite` in this directory is a verbatim,
unmodified copy of Google's published MediaPipe BlazeFace (short-range)
face-detection model. It is redistributed here under the Apache License,
Version 2.0; the full licence text is in `LICENSE` beside this file.

  Model:        MediaPipe BlazeFace, short-range variant
  Author:       Valentin Bazarevsky, Google
  Model card:   Yury Kartynnik and Artsiom Ablavatski, Google (9 June 2021)
  Licence:      Apache License, Version 2.0
                http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
  Source:       https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/
                face_detector/blaze_face_short_range/float16/1/
                blaze_face_short_range.tflite
  Model card:   https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-assets/
                MediaPipe%20BlazeFace%20Model%20Card%20(Short%20Range).pdf

The licence is stated on the model card itself, under "LICENSED UNDER":
"Apache License, Version 2.0". The card also gives the model's size as
224 KB, which matches this file.

Citation, quoted from the model card rather than reconstructed:

  V. Bazarevsky et al. BlazeFace: Sub-millisecond Neural Face Detection
  on Mobile GPUs. CVPR Workshop on Computer Vision for Augmented and
  Virtual Reality, Long Beach, CA, USA, 2019.

  Documentation paper, per the card: https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.10204

The MediaPipe WASM runtime staged into `wasm/` by `npm run stage:mediapipe`
is also Apache 2.0 — it is copied out of the `@mediapipe/tasks-vision`
package, whose `package.json` declares `"license": "Apache-2.0"`. Those
files are gitignored rather than committed, so they are not redistributed
by this repository; they arrive from npm on each install.

Nothing in this directory is modified from what Google published.
